    "detailed_description": "The &quot;Sacabambaspis&quot; is not a very good swimmer. It will swim automatically, but as it does so, continuously rise to the sea surface.<br />\r\nPress the button to make it dive to the bottom of the ocean.<br />\r\nTry to go as far as you can without hitting any obstacles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you rise too high, dive too low, or hit an obstacle, it's game over.<br />\r\n(It's fine if you hit the air bubbles!)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you continue to swim, it becomes increasingly difficult.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt might become night time, or you might go to the past or the future!?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeat your high score and brag to your friends!",
    "about_the_game": "The &quot;Sacabambaspis&quot; is not a very good swimmer. It will swim automatically, but as it does so, continuously rise to the sea surface.<br />\r\nPress the button to make it dive to the bottom of the ocean.<br />\r\nTry to go as far as you can without hitting any obstacles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you rise too high, dive too low, or hit an obstacle, it's game over.<br />\r\n(It's fine if you hit the air bubbles!)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you continue to swim, it becomes increasingly difficult.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt might become night time, or you might go to the past or the future!?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeat your high score and brag to your friends!",
    "short_description": "The ancient fish \u201cSacabambaspis\u201d game! Easy to operate but difficult! Let's compete to see how far you can swim!",
